		)
		(uuid "537be913-83f3-4f39-a65f-3824d3688aea")
	)
	(text "Power notes (plans/usb-power.md):\n- Load sharing: VBUS -> D7 -> VSYS with USB, VBAT -> Q1 -> VSYS on battery (Q1 gate on VBUS). The charger only sees the battery, so it terminates.\n- JP3 picks the charge current: 1-2 = R21 2k (500 mA, default), 2-3 = R33 10k (100 mA). JP1 / JP2: cut to measure the VBAT / 3V3 drain.\n- JP4 picks VS1053 AVDD: AP7312 OUT2 (default) or the 3V3 through FB3.\n- PCB: tie the bat-man1 exposed pad to GND (not in the symbol). L3 uses the XAL4020 land pattern, check it against the XFL4015 doc.\n- U11 (TPS63802) and U12 (MAX17048 TDFN) are not stocked at JLC: source them separately."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.51 193.548 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9a878b4e-4a3c-47c4-9765-779c9476c963")
	)
	(text "Battery Management"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 149.606 48.26 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "a69e8bdc-f779-4cd7-87d3-ab5787eba455")
	)
	(text "Regulation (LDO)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 213.106 48.26 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "d5e42afe-c356-4c43-b6f9-9851b5f0e81c")
	)
	(text_box "Adafruit is using a 5K resistor for r21, which gives less current \n(196 instead of 50mA) in the IBat =>  slower charge but less heat\nand some small batteries can be dammaged by too much current. \nNeed to adjust once we chose the battery."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14.224 14.734 0)
		(size 36.83 23.622)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
